    "question": "A mass of 2.0 g of dry steam at 100°C is passed into 50.0 g of water at 20°C contained in a vessel of negligible heat capacity. What is the resulting temperature of the mixture? (L_v = 540 cal/g, c_w = 1 cal/(g·°C))",
